":{"id":"S11215","name":{"zh":"威震华夏","en":"Might Resounds Across China"},"year":"219","month":"7"},"faction":"WJ10020","city":"CS1065","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[78,77,71,62,65,80],"title":-1,"rank":"8","loyalty":"100","reputation":"5500","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10014","armor":"WP1001505","helmet":"WP1023105"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10702","name":{"zh":"夷陵之战","en":"Battle of Yiling"},"year":"221","month":"5"},"faction":"WJ10020","city":"CS1060","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[78,77,71,62,65,80],"title":-1,"rank":"8","loyalty":"100","reputation":"5900","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10014","armor":"WP1001505","helmet":"WP1023105"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10115","name":{"zh":"征讨南蛮","en":"Southern Campaign"},"year":"225","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10020","city":"CS1060","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[78,77,71,62,65,80],"title":-1,"rank":"8","loyalty":"100","reputation":"5900","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10014","armor":"WP1001505","helmet":"WP1023105"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10915","name":{"zh":"北伐中原","en":"Northern Expedition"},"year":"227","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10020","city":"CS1060","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":3,"stats":[78,77,71,62,65,80],"title":-1,"rank":"5","loyalty":"100","reputation":"5900","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10014","armor":"WP1001505","helmet":"WP1023105"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11015","name":{"zh":"再出岐山","en":"Return to Qishan"},"year":"231","month":"1"},"faction":"WJ10020","city":"CS1060","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":3,"stats":[78,77,71,62,65,80],"title":-1,"rank":"5","loyalty":"100","reputation":"5900","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10014","armor":"WP1001505","helmet":"WP1023105"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11115","name":{"zh":"五丈原","en":"Wuzhang Plains"},"year":"234","month":"1"},"faction":"WJ10020","city":"CS1060","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":3,"stats":[78,77,71,62,65,80],"title":-1,"rank":"5","loyalty":"100","reputation":"5900","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10014","armor":"WP1001505","helmet":"WP1023105"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":"WJ10020","city":"CS1060","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":3,"stats":[78,77,71,62,65,80],"title":-1,"rank":"5","loyalty":"100","reputation":"5900","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10014","armor":"WP1001505","helmet":"WP1023105"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1053","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[78,77,71,62,65,80],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"5400","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10014","armor":"WP1001505","helmet":"WP1023105"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10020","city":"CS1053","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[78,77,71,62,65,80],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"99","reputation":"5400","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10014","armor":"WP1001505","helmet":"WP1023105"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"吴国武将。出身将门，其父吕范为东吴开国元勋。太元元年，随从太常潘濬征讨五溪蛮，大获全胜，稳固了东吴后方。孙权去世后，东吴陷入权臣相继专权的混乱局面。东兴之战中作为诸葛恪部下与唐资、留赞一同作战。太平元年，因不满孙綝专权乱政，与滕胤等大臣密谋推翻孙綝。计划泄露后，孙綝抢先动手，迫使吕据在进退无路的情况下，选择悲壮自尽以保全气节。夷三族。","tc":"吳國武將。出身將門，其父呂范為東吳開國元勛。太元元年，隨從太常潘濬征討五溪蠻，大獲全勝，穩固了東吳后方。孫權去世后，東吳陷入權臣相繼專權的混亂局面。東興之戰中作為諸葛恪部下與唐資、留贊一同作戰。太平元年，因不滿孫綝專權亂政，與滕胤等大臣密謀推翻孫綝。計劃泄露后，孫綝搶先動手，迫使呂據在進退無路的情況下，選擇悲壯自盡以保全氣節。夷三族。","en":"An officer of Wu. Born into a military family, his father Lu Fan was a founding hero of Eastern Wu. In the 1st year of Taiyuan (251), he accompanied Undersecretary Pan Jun on a campaign against the Wuxi Man tribes, winning a great victory and stabilizing Eastern Wu's rear. After Sun Quan's death, Eastern Wu descended into chaos as a succession of power-hungry ministers seized control. During the Battle of Dongxing, he fought under Zhuge Ke alongside Tang Zi and Liu Zan. In the 1st year of Taiping (256), dissatisfied with Sun Chen's tyrannical rule, he conspired with Teng Yin and other ministers to overthrow Sun Chen. When the plot was discovered, Sun Chen struck first, leaving Lu Ju with no way out. He chose to take his own life to preserve his integrity rather than submit. His entire clan was exterminated.","jp":"呉の武将。将門の家柄に生まれ、父の呂範は東呉の開国の元勲であった。太元元年、太常の潘濬に従って五渓蛮を討伐し、大勝を収めて東呉の後方を安定させた。孫権の死後、東呉は権臣が相次いで専権を振るう混乱に陥る。東興の戦いでは諸葛恪の配下として唐資、留賛らと共に参戦した。太平元年、孫綝の専横と乱政に憤り、滕胤ら重臣と孫綝の打倒を密謀する。計画が露見して孫綝に先手を打たれると、進退窮まった呂拠は気節を保つため壮絶な自害を遂げた。三族は皆殺しとなった。","kr":"오나라의 무장. 장수 가문 출신으로, 부친 여범은 동오의 개국공신이다. 태원 원년, 태상 반준을 수행해 오계만을 토벌하고 대승을 거두며 동오의 후방을 안정시켰다. 손권이 세상을 떠난 뒤, 동오는 권신들이 잇달아 전횡을 일삼는 혼란에 빠졌다. 동흥 전투에서는 제갈각의 부하로서 당자, 유찬과 함께 출전했다. 태평 원년, 손침이 권력을 독점하고 국정을 어지럽히자 이에 불만을 품고 등윤 등의 대신들과 함께 손침을 몰아내고자 모의했다. 그러나 계획이 누설되자 손침이 먼저 손을 썼고, 진퇴양난에 빠진 여거는 절개를 지키고자 비장하게 자결을 택했다. 사후 삼족이 멸해졌다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10650","remark":"","surname":"吕","surnameTc":"呂","surnameEn":"Lu","surnameJp":"呂","surnameKr":"여","surnameOther":"","name":"据","nameTc":"據","nameEn":"Ju","nameJp":"拠","nameKr":"거","nameOther":"","word":"世议","wordTc":"世議","wordEn":"Shiyi","wordJp":"世評","wordKr":"세의","wordOther":"","icon":"吕据","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"0","workYear":"210","city":"CS1053","gender":"0","rule":"78","force":"77","wise":"71","politics":"62","charm":"65","will":"80","ruleTalent":"10","forceTalent":"7","wiseTalent":"8","politicsTalent":"6","charmTalent":"6","willTalent":"9","weaponMaster":"20/20/66/20/20/46/50/20","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"1021702;1001602","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"S1008105","battleSoul":"","deb